  "description": "Sales CRM tools powered by the SmartLink Basics 6-KPI framework. Connects Claude to your CRM and gives it the sales coaching methodology to interpret your data — not just report it. Includes pipeline reviews, deal risk analysis, coaching prep, and forecast assessments. Built by a sales leader, not a vendor.",
